		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll before</i> or
				<i>at the feet of, prostrate oneself before</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἰκτίνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					501
				</span></i>
			 (cf. Sch.), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				6.2
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όμενον</span>
			)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.338
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκαλ-</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; τῶν θείων ἰχνῶν</span> Wilcken <i><span class="en">
